#: search:search_D216F5A2_90FB_432B_8641_E77B5EBFC230
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c793e3518b1e86e08b2348b0c292f5ce1c3b0aa07b1067a3035172d42ca6ab2d
#. default-sha256: 7067a9a77f47b35706546546fc8eb0d33ce51c0ae555cfe598df4d32aa884088
msgctxt "search:search_D216F5A2_90FB_432B_8641_E77B5EBFC230"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Oh, there you are, Master. ⟪k:5⟫You gave me quite the scare.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"After returning from the third door, you disappeared without a word."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ahh, eccola, Padrone. ⟪k:5⟫Mi ha fatto spaventare.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Al ritorno "
"dalla terza porta, l’ho completamente persa di vista."

#: search:search_76472D0C_19F0_45BD_95FE_38AFC767ED36
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c52d65080948c05ec112bf14c3460cbf223f2977331b54248424682d9096f8bd
#. default-sha256: 07131b69085c40b55851b8f7982c8948ded36db8164aebcfa58f3b4d5618870e
msgctxt "search:search_76472D0C_19F0_45BD_95FE_38AFC767ED36"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was you who disappeared..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Cosa...?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Sei tu che sei scomparsa senza dire nulla..."

#: search:search_3F44A27A_5E4B_498F_81C9_43A353E7CFEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c562d400cebe370a76f2f7108dbaba6cc9bec10241c6d75ef05ca96694dea56
#. default-sha256: 9b12087f320dd845572257f64be43bdf7d82fd2cba53e0dd607b8cb2a7927c3b
msgctxt "search:search_3F44A27A_5E4B_498F_81C9_43A353E7CFEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh my... ⟪k:3⟫It was ⟪k:4⟫I⟪k:5⟫ who disappeared?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫That is quite strange. "
"I did not go anywhere, as far as I am aware."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come dice? ⟪k:3⟫Sono io ad essere scomparsa?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫È⟪k:7⟫ alquanto strano. "
"Non sono andata da nessuna parte, a quanto ne so."

#: search:search_E2712B82_695C_4D54_A63F_254D4F55FE9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5314218f19e5bd028f9d3963e812c366c31a9e1ca16bea6ec3c9a593eaa58b63
#. default-sha256: a13d8a97124a27b65f6014ebf9f699f70267234baa36871da8ae36e01723248c
msgctxt "search:search_E2712B82_695C_4D54_A63F_254D4F55FE9C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nevertheless, I am glad to have found you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I would have been at a complete "
"loss for what to do⟪k:4⟫if I had been separated from you yet again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ad ogni modo, sono felice di averla ritrovata.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non saprei cosa fare... ⟪k:4⟫se "
"venissi separata da lei un’altra volta."

#: search:search_984DB043_1880_4220_B63F_8C140C1860F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f36557ecb5623774c6ed3fe53e6cae4249790f643911c657439cc6def8063449
#. default-sha256: 839c97b86df90409439b4e526945ecc57d5e112ecb70f6c232e0daf4c25fd521
