msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Am I in mine, though...?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Io, invece...?)"

#: search:search_E72785FD_5854_43DD_B8DA_45D0F2A1512F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de233d9aa6e952843f9967035e2d2ef3d9b4644f7c55798d2253a8c500faacdd
#. default-sha256: fada950223dc96c84fd93bfee5f957194206d526228bd689bf057a7ea56a651b
msgctxt "search:search_E72785FD_5854_43DD_B8DA_45D0F2A1512F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe... ⟪k:3⟫I am very much not a ghost.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Would I be able to hold your "
"hand if I were?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe... ⟪k:3⟫non sono affatto un fantasma.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫O non sarei capace di "
"reggere la sua mano, le pare?"

#: search:search_7860D620_E190_48D4_80A9_0805BEAEAB0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73b69fde09b3aa0d1658aaab61993c2c2fd776d9427b0b197faaf68dbab803b5
#. default-sha256: 946951700c8621f4b1995fe1034938c397fd5810335c4db77a0d694a5ab8eb02
msgctxt "search:search_7860D620_E190_48D4_80A9_0805BEAEAB0E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Saying this, the Maid took ⟪k:1⟫Your⟪k:2⟫the Departed’s⟪k:3⟫ hand.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It was cold "
"enough to send a shudder down ⟪k:6⟫Your⟪k:7⟫his⟪k:8⟫ spine—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫and completely devoid "
"of life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Detto ciò, la Domestica ⟪k:1⟫Ti prese per mano⟪k:2⟫prese per mano il Defunto⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"Era talmente fredda—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫così priva di vita—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫da far⟪k:10⟫ti⟪k:11⟫gli⟪k:12⟫ venire i "
"brividi."

#: search:search_878F0081_8437_4841_BF7E_8563EAA5D849
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ca2b7c4434c022cc677d269bcf57eb9a6c4ebea3792596df971c39b27c96eeb
#. default-sha256: 29471dbc1d41774a58bb4624bcb1c373e7b15afba31ce3010c77dfdea01a894a
msgctxt "search:search_878F0081_8437_4841_BF7E_8563EAA5D849"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though, as chilling as it may have been,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You⟪k:3⟫he⟪k:4⟫ still took comfort in the "
"feeling of her hand in ⟪k:5⟫Yours⟪k:6⟫his⟪k:7⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eppure, per quanto gelida potesse essere, ⟪k:1⟫trovavi⟪k:2⟫il Defunto trovava⟪k:3⟫ conforto "
"nel tenerla per mano."

#: search:search_48AD1506_DC35_4A5B_A899_B0176737D537
