msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"

#: search:search_A345CB21_107B_42AB_A6B9_316312D1F2B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd83c01a5025c8740cd665900d2f24c10b52f64cf8d6301b9f7f90715823ee5c
#. default-sha256: 3a8c6ece08d1862890fb7d341cf54be4d045923d638a4c39b26d244295a83647
