msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(then maybe we could still touch each other...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(forse saremmo in grado di toccarci comunque...)"

#: search:search_BE70A293_14BB_44D3_B717_34A0A7CB01F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97e29cb96d6cd6eb1e358f927f8868d49da0c4a700dd96b148b2c8d97aa44266
#. default-sha256: 6877ca7e05fe76cc977ba6cec29877383f1e98c490919cc578ee1817ada6941d
msgctxt "search:search_BE70A293_14BB_44D3_B717_34A0A7CB01F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The Maid looked down at ⟪k:2⟫You⟪k:3⟫the Departed⟪k:4⟫ with gentle eyes.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫After "
"a few moments of silence, she sat down beside ⟪k:7⟫You⟪k:8⟫him⟪k:9⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La Domestica ⟪k:2⟫Ti⟪k:3⟫lo⟪k:4⟫ guardò con occhi dolci.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Dopo qualche attimo "
"di silenzio, la donna si sedette al ⟪k:7⟫Tuo⟪k:8⟫suo⟪k:9⟫ fianco."

#: search:search_BEAAC580_B175_4481_AE5D_63395807E2B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d2eb1ba170ef7bd84d884e60c5929d85901d4f1216ca0e49fa846a29d3755bc
#. default-sha256: 07582b12af284b60625e72ea81fe54fc3433a7049eb23b79c9f3dd7c39ea549e
msgctxt "search:search_BEAAC580_B175_4481_AE5D_63395807E2B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The stained glass is quite beautiful, is it not?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Every time I see it, it "
"brings a tranquility to my heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La vetrata è così bella, non trova?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ogni volta che la vedo, il mio cuore si "
"tranquillizza."

#: search:search_941FE887_F170_4A2B_B2C7_D979756D989E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46dec0126c90586211d457b8f035284376b66ba04c93dc90da95b46ad5c845a5
